        <div class="bg-gray-800/50 p-4 rounded-lg mt-8">
          <p class="text-gray-400 mb-2">Usage example:</p>
          <pre class="text-gray-300 overflow-auto"><code>{`<Timeline
  variant="compact"
  title="Vision Timeline"
  hue="blue"
  compactItems={[
    { period: "2025-2030", title: "Infrastructure\\n& Foundation" },
    { period: "2030-2035", title: "System\\nIntegration" },
